{"about_the_game":"<i>This is a free prologue for the Riot Control Simulator game, where you can have a short sneak peek at the gameplay and overall game experience.</i> In &quot;Riot Control Simulator: Rookie Day,&quot; step into the boots of a law enforcement officer faced with their first mission: managing security during minor riots sparked by pseudo-fans after a local football match. Experience life at the station, prepping for the task ahead.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535680/extras/3add8e240fbd5602dda0e08b8d66599b.poster.avif?t=1755435916\" width=640 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535680/extras/3add8e240fbd5602dda0e08b8d66599b.webm?t=1755435916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535680/extras/3add8e240fbd5602dda0e08b8d66599b.mp4?t=1755435916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your mission is to prevent clashes between these pseudo-fans on the streets. Safely clear the area of bystanders and other fans lingering near the local pub. Establish a secure perimeter using barriers or police cordons to isolate the riot zone. Develop your skills in responding to aggressive individuals, be they riotous pseudo-fans or concerned citizens. Depending on the situation, employ various means, from negotiation to the use of batons, tasers, or gas. Handle confrontations by issuing fines or detaining and searching unruly individuals.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535680/extras/b5d951809e23abdd43d9ff59e27160c3.poster.avif?t=1755435916\" width=610 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535680/extras/b5d951809e23abdd43d9ff59e27160c3.webm?t=1755435916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535680/extras/b5d951809e23abdd43d9ff59e27160c3.mp4?t=1755435916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Throughout, you'll be supported by your squad. Issue them precise commands, and collaboratively work to avoid escalating the situation further, prioritizing the safety of bystanders above all.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2535680?t=1755435916","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535680/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755435916","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535680/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755435916","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535680/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755435916","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<i>This is a free prologue for the Riot Control Simulator game, where you can have a short sneak peek at the gameplay and overall game experience.</i> In &quot;Riot Control Simulator: Rookie Day,&quot; step into the boots of a law enforcement officer faced with their first mission: managing security during minor riots sparked by pseudo-fans after a local football match. Experience life at the station, prepping for the task ahead.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535680/extras/3add8e240fbd5602dda0e08b8d66599b.poster.avif?t=1755435916\" width=640 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535680/extras/3add8e240fbd5602dda0e08b8d66599b.webm?t=1755435916\" 